#. Supplementary OpenSC2K translation; original terminology used where
#. available.
msgid "The adjacent amount shows the estimated annual budget effect."
msgstr "O valor ao lado mostra o efeito anual estimado no orçamento."

#. Original Brazilian CD WIN95/SC2K/SIMCITY.EXE STRINGTABLE 375
msgid "Sunday "
msgstr "Domingo"

